        "created_at": "2025-02-24T11:54:10.587Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Dear Sir/Ma’am,<br>\nI am writing to request your consideration regarding the Biweekly Programming Tests (BPTs) for System Commands Course. Due to a heavy academic workload and scheduling challenges as a dual-enrolled student, I was unable to meet the deadlines and, unfortunately, missed the first two BPTs. I understand that this affects my eligibility for the OPPE, as the course requires a minimum score of 40 in the first three BPTs and hence I will not get my Final Course grade. I attempted assignments and quiz1 but missed these.</p>\n<p>I deeply regret this situation and want to assure you that I am fully committed to the course. If there is any possibility of an extension or an alternative way to make up for the missed tests, I would be truly grateful. I am willing to put in additional effort to compensate for the missed assessments.</p>\n<p>I sincerely appreciate your time and consideration and would be grateful for any guidance you can provide.</p>",
